      "writtenOn": "2026-02-03T20:31:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `this.sendMail` detects if the operation should trigger an e-mail notification or not. Abusing this flag with the enablement of the e-mail subsystem would cause the trigger e-mails if someone calls the `setSendMail(true)` even if the sending of e-mail is disabled.\n\n```suggestion\n    this.sendEmailEnabled \u003d sendEmailEnabled;\n    this.sendMail \u003d true;\n```",
      "revId": "fb2ec500b177989405dbcca3eb0d8987105230e8",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
