      "message": "Good catch.\nI thought the only usage of `setSendMail(false)` was from the `ConsistencyCheckerIT` test, but `ReceiveCommits` also explicitly sets this explicitly with `setSendMail(true)`: not sure why, since the default is already `true`.\n\nAnyway, I will keep the two flags separated.",
